          "explanation": "This is an explicit user override for a strategy-only plan. The accepted outcome is to defer the Circuit methods scope with no new work today, so no activity is booked or offered. The scope entry is retained so the strategic intent remains visible and can be revisited later, but no learning, practice, or assessment is designed now.",
