            "The 120-minute changed-circuit check cannot fit one 60-minute day, so genuine split points are declared instead of shrinking the assessment or replacing it with a preparatory task."
          ],
          "unresolvedUncertainty": [
            "The exact taught method list is inferred from the outcome; if the learner's course taught a different set, the activity instructions require flagging it before proceeding."
          ],
          "stoppingConditions": [
            "Stop when four of five changed circuits are solved correctly with valid method choice and reason, unaided; or record the remaining gap honestly as unresolved."
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
